{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["要倚靠主，而非埃及"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那些下到埃及寻求帮助的人有祸了！",{"text":"他们仰赖战马，倚靠众多的战车和强壮的骑兵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却不仰望以色列的圣者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不寻求耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，耶和华有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有能力降灾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从不食言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必惩罚恶人之家及其帮凶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人不过是人，并非上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及的战马是血肉之躯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并不是灵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华一伸手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些帮凶必踉跄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受帮助的必跌倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必一同灭亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和华对我说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“猛狮守护猎物，发出咆哮。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使叫来许多牧人一起攻击它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它也不会因他们的呐喊而惧怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不会因他们的叫嚷而畏缩。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同样，万军之耶和华必降临在锡安山上争战。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华必保护耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像飞鸟展翅保护幼雏一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必护卫它，搭救它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必越过它，解救它。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["以色列人啊，你们已经严重悖逆耶和华，现在归向祂吧！"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["到那日，你们都要抛弃自己罪恶双手制造的金银偶像。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“亚述人必丧身刀下，但并非人的刀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必被刀吞噬，但并非凡人的刀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必逃避这刀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的青年必做苦役。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的堡垒必因恐惧而陷落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的将领一看见战旗就惊慌失措。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的火在锡安，祂的火炉在耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/32.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}